{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/technology' data-target='computer\/technology' data-title='Technology'>\r\n\t\t\tTechnology\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"CAP: a distributed system cannot simultaneously provide consistency, availability, and partition tolerance.","label":"CAP Theorem","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/technology\/algorithms","label":"Algorithms","url":"\/computer\/technology\/algorithms"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/technology\/design","label":"Design","url":"\/computer\/technology\/design"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t\t<div class='content-image-container'>\r\n\t<div class='cover-image cover-image-tile'>\r\n\t\t<img src='\/computer\/technology\/cap_theorem.svg' alt='CAP: a distributed system cannot simultaneously provide consistency, availability, and partition tolerance.' style='object-fit: contain; object-position: center'>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<p class='cover-credit'>\n\t<span class='cover-credit-anchor'>\n\t\t<button type='button' class='cover-credit-toggle' aria-expanded='false' aria-label='Image credit'>\n\t\t\t<svg xmlns='http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg' viewBox='0 0 16 16' width='14' height='14' aria-hidden='true' focusable='false'>\n\t\t\t\t<circle cx='8' cy='8' r='6.25' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.2'\/>\n\t\t\t\t<circle cx='8' cy='5.2' r='0.85' fill='currentColor'\/>\n\t\t\t\t<path fill='currentColor' d='M7.28 7.15h1.44v4.55H7.28z'\/>\n\t\t\t<\/svg>\n\t\t<\/button>\n\t\t<span class='cover-credit-popup'><a class=\"content-link cover-credit-link\" href=\"https:\/\/commons.wikimedia.org\/wiki\/File%3ACAP_Theorem.svg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Mooond<\/a> \/ <a class=\"content-link cover-credit-link\" href=\"https:\/\/commons.wikimedia.org\/wiki\/File%3ACAP_Theorem.svg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Wikimedia Commons<\/a> \u2014 <a class=\"content-link cover-credit-link\" href=\"https:\/\/creativecommons.org\/licenses\/by-sa\/4.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC BY-SA 4.0<\/a><\/span>\n\t<\/span>\n<\/p>\n\n\t<h2 class='center'>CAP: a distributed system cannot simultaneously provide consistency, availability, and partition tolerance.<\/h2>\n\t\t<p>\n\t\tScope: distributed computing and database systems.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Statement<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tIt is impossible for a distributed computing \/ database system to simultaneously provide the three:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Consistency<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tEvery read receives the most recent write or an error. This means that the system appears as if there is a single copy of the data, and all reads will return the same value.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Availability<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tEvery request receives a (non-error) response \u2014 without the guarantee that it contains the most recent write. This ensures that the system is always up and running, and every query receives a reply.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Partition tolerance<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tThe system continues to operate despite an arbitrary number of messages being dropped (or delayed) by the network between nodes. In essence, the system can withstand network failures.\n\t<\/p>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/technology\/cap_theorem\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/technology\/cap_theorem\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/technology\/algorithms' data-target='computer\/technology\/algorithms' data-title='Algorithms' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/computer\/technology\/algorithms.jpg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>Algorithms<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/technology\/design' data-target='computer\/technology\/design' data-title='Design' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Design<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/technology' data-target='computer\/technology' data-title='Technology'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/computer\/technology.jpg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Technology<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}